# Data Operations Work Workspace

- Root: `C:\Users\<USERNAME>\Projects\data-operations-workspace`
- Start Data Operations sessions with `/data-ops-preflight` (skill: `data-ops-preflight`).
- Scripts: `scripts/` — `data_ops_preflight.py`, `oracle_query.py`, `group_structure_pack.py`, `edit_tool_company_import_uploader.py`
- SQL library: `sql/bk`, `sql/group`, `sql/legal`, `sql/sos`, `sql/proc`
- Dated outputs: `work/YYYY-MM-DD/`
- Automation: `automation/` (bankruptcy-unmatched-daily)
- Skills live in `%USERPROFILE%\.agents\skills\` and are mirrored under `.cursor/skills/` for coworkers (data-ops, data-ops-preflight, entity-group-structure-workflow, group-structure-pack, google-alert-review, bankruptcy-unmatched-review, …)
- Group-structure docs: `docs/group-structure/` (README + reference + examples)
